---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>ModY is a static website. We don't run accounts, we don't set tracking cookies, and we don't collect personal information on this site.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> not live yet. The signup button opens your own email app, and nothing is stored here.</li>
      <li><strong>Hosting:</strong> the site is hosted on Vercel, which may keep standard server logs (such as IP address and request time) for security and operations.</li>
      <li><strong>Outbound links:</strong> retailer and manufacturer sites have their own privacy policies.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If we add analytics, affiliate links, or a real newsletter provider, we'll update this page first.</p>
    <p style="font-size:.85rem">Last updated: October 2026.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
